<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title><%= payment ? 'Pembayaran ' + formatRupiah(payment.amount) : 'Pembayaran QRIS' %> - <%= storeName %> | <%= appName %></title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brandBlue: '#1a73e8',
                        brandBlueHover: '#1557b0',
                        brandEmerald: '#10b981',
                        brandRose: '#f43f5e',
                        darkBg: '#090d16',
                        darkCard: '#111827',
                        darkCardElevated: '#1f293d',
                        darkBorder: '#1f293d',
                        darkSubtext: '#94a3b8'
                    },
                    animation: {
                        'pulse-fast': 'pulse 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite',
                        'scan': 'scanLine 3s ease-in-out infinite'
                    },
                    keyframes: {
                        scanLine: {
                            '0%, 100%': { transform: 'translateY(0%)', opacity: '0.2' },
                            '50%': { transform: 'translateY(230px)', opacity: '0.9' }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Font Awesome 6 & Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.9.3/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .font-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
        
        @keyframes float-subtle {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
        }
        .animate-float { animation: float-subtle 3s ease-in-out infinite; }

        @keyframes pop-in {
            0% { transform: scale(0.92); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pop-in { animation: pop-in 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; }

        /* Tech corner brackets for QR container */
        .corner-bracket {
            position: absolute;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .corner-tl { top: 8px; left: 8px; border-top-width: 2.5px; border-left-width: 2.5px; border-top-left-radius: 6px; }
        .corner-tr { top: 8px; right: 8px; border-top-width: 2.5px; border-right-width: 2.5px; border-top-right-radius: 6px; }
        .corner-bl { bottom: 8px; left: 8px; border-bottom-width: 2.5px; border-left-width: 2.5px; border-bottom-left-radius: 6px; }
        .corner-br { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; border-bottom-width: 2.5px; border-right-width: 2.5px; border-bottom-right-radius: 6px; }

        /* Print formatting for clean thermal receipt */
        @media print {
            body { background: #fff !important; color: #000 !important; }
            header, footer, #btn-toggle-theme-mode, #sound-toggle-btn, button, #btn-redirect-now, .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
            #checkout-card {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: none !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
            }
            #receipt-details {
                border: 1px dashed #000 !important;
                background: transparent !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-darkBg text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between transition-colors duration-200">

    <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
    <header class="bg-white/90 dark:bg-darkCard/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-darkBorder px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sticky top-0 z-40 transition-colors duration-200">
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
            <!-- Merchant Info -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <% if (typeof storeLogoUrl !== 'undefined' && storeLogoUrl) { %>
                    <img src="<%= storeLogoUrl %>" alt="<%= storeName %>" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-sky-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold shadow-md shadow-blue-500/20">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
                        <span class="truncate max-w-[170px] sm:max-w-xs"><%= storeName %></span>
                        <span class="text-sky-500 text-xs" title="Official Verified Merchant">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                        </span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-darkSubtext font-medium flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span>QRIS Merchant Resmi</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400">• <%= appName %></span>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action Controls: Theme Mode, Sound & Dark Mode -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 sm:space-x-2">
                <!-- Theme Celebration Mode Switcher (Anime / Default) -->
                <button id="btn-toggle-theme-mode" onclick="toggleSuccessThemeMode()" 
                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-darkCardElevated dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 transition border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm" 
                    title="Ganti Mode Tampilan Sukses (Anime / Default Fintech)">
                    <span id="badge-theme-mode" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                    <span id="label-theme-mode" class="hidden sm:inline">Mode Anime</span>
                </button>

                <!-- Sound Mute/Unmute Toggle -->
                <button id="sound-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleSound()" 
                    class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-darkCardElevated dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center transition border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm" 
                    title="Aktifkan / Bisukan Notifikasi Suara">
                    <i id="sound-icon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-xs sm:text-sm"></i>
                </button>

                <!-- Dark / Light Mode Switch -->
                <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" 
                    class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-darkCardElevated dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center transition border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm" 
                    title="Ganti Mode Tampilan (Gelap / Terang)">
                    <i id="theme-icon" class="fa-solid fa-moon text-xs sm:text-sm"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Payment Container -->
    <main class="max-w-md w-full mx-auto px-4 py-4 sm:py-6 my-auto">

        <% if (error || !payment) { %>
            <!-- Error / Expired Payment Card -->
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard rounded-[32px] p-8 shadow-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder text-center animate-pop-in">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/60 text-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Tagihan Tidak Tersedia</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-darkSubtext mt-2 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    <%= error || 'Tagihan QRIS tidak ditemukan atau telah kedaluwarsa.' %>
                </p>
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                    <p class="font-medium">Silakan hubungi penjual di <strong><%= storeName %></strong> untuk membuat link pembayaran baru.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>

            <!-- Active Checkout Card -->
            <div id="checkout-card" class="bg-white dark:bg-darkCard rounded-[32px] p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-xl shadow-slate-300/40 dark:shadow-none border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-darkBorder relative transition-colors duration-200 animate-pop-in">

                <!-- STAGE 1: PENDING / WAITING PAYMENT -->
                <div id="stage-waiting" class="<%= payment.status === 'PAID' ? 'hidden' : '' %>">
                    
                    <!-- Order Bar -->
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-darkBorder mb-4">
                        <div class="text-left pr-2">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 dark:text-darkSubtext">Pesanan</span>
                            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 truncate max-w-[210px]" title="<%= payment.custom_name %>">
                                <%= payment.custom_name %>
                            </h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900 select-all" title="Klik untuk salin ID Tagihan">
                                <%= payment.payment_id %>
                            </span>
                            <button type="button" onclick="copyText('<%= payment.payment_id %>', 'copy-id-icon')" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-500 text-xs flex items-center justify-center transition" title="Salin ID Tagihan">
                                <i id="copy-id-icon" class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Nominal Hero Card -->
                    <div class="p-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/70 via-indigo-50/30 to-slate-50/80 dark:from-slate-800/90 dark:via-slate-800/50 dark:to-slate-900/40 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-center mb-4 relative overflow-hidden">
                        <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-slate-500 dark:text-darkSubtext flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                            <span>Total Pembayaran</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-[10px] text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400"></i>
                        </p>
                        
                        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-mono text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400 tracking-tight my-1.5 select-all">
                            <%= formatRupiah(payment.amount) %>
                        </h2>

                        <!-- 1-Click Copy Nominal Button -->
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-2">
                            <button type="button" id="btn-copy-amount" onclick="copyAmount('<%= payment.amount %>')" 
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 hover:text-brandBlue dark:hover:text-sky-400 bg-white dark:bg-darkCard px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition active:scale-95">
                                <i id="copy-icon" class="fa-regular fa-copy text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400"></i>
                                <span id="copy-text">Salin Nominal Tepat</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">
                            *Transfer sesuai nominal tepat agar verifikasi mutasi otomatis berjalan instan.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dynamic QRIS Display Container -->
                    <div id="qr-container" class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center my-3 relative overflow-hidden group">
                        <!-- High-Tech Corner Brackets -->
                        <div class="corner-bracket corner-tl"></div>
                        <div class="corner-bracket corner-tr"></div>
                        <div class="corner-bracket corner-bl"></div>
                        <div class="corner-bracket corner-br"></div>

                        <!-- Scan Line Animation -->
                        <div id="scan-line" class="absolute left-6 right-6 top-6 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-sky-400 to-transparent pointer-events-none animate-scan shadow-[0_0_8px_#38bdf8]"></div>

                        <!-- Official QRIS Header -->
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full px-2 mb-2">
                            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/Logo_QRIS.svg" class="h-5" alt="QRIS Standar Pembayaran Nasional">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400">
                                NMID: ID1024341992468
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- QR Image with Expired Overlay -->
                        <div class="relative w-60 h-60 flex items-center justify-center bg-white rounded-xl p-1 shadow-inner">
                            <img id="qr-img" src="<%= payment.qr_image %>" alt="QRIS Code YuriPay" class="w-full h-full object-contain rounded-lg">
                            
                            <!-- Expired Overlay (Shown dynamically when time runs out) -->
                            <div id="qr-expired-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/85 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-4 text-white hidden">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-2">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i>
                                </div>
                                <h4 class="font-extrabold text-sm text-rose-300">Tagihan Kedaluwarsa</h4>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-1">Batas waktu pembayaran telah habis. Silakan buat pesanan baru.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- QR Actions: Download & Copy Raw QR String -->
                        <div class="mt-3.5 flex items-center justify-between w-full px-1 text-xs font-bold">
                            <a id="btn-download-qr" href="<%= payment.qr_image %>" download="QRIS-<%= payment.order_id || payment.payment_id %>.png" 
                               class="text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400 hover:text-brandBlueHover dark:hover:text-sky-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                                <span>Unduh QR</span>
                            </a>

                            <% if (payment.qris_code) { %>
                                <button type="button" onclick="copyText('<%= payment.qris_code %>', 'copy-qris-icon')" 
                                    class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-brandBlue dark:hover:text-sky-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                                    <i id="copy-qris-icon" class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i>
                                    <span>Salin Kode QR</span>
                                </button>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dynamic Countdown Timer & Smooth Animated Progress Bar -->
                    <div id="countdown-card" class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder mb-4 transition-colors">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2">
                            <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-darkSubtext flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400"></i>
                                <span>Sisa Batas Waktu Bayar:</span>
                            </span>
                            <span id="countdown-badge" class="font-mono font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-300/50 dark:border-emerald-800 transition-colors">
                                <span id="countdown-timer">--:--</span>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Progress Bar Track -->
                        <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden">
                            <div id="countdown-progress-bar" class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-emerald-500 transition-all duration-500 ease-linear" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Realtime Polling Status Indicator -->
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-darkSubtext mb-4">
                        <span id="ping-dot" class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brandBlue dark:bg-sky-400 animate-ping inline-block"></span>
                        <span id="status-label" class="font-medium">Mengecek mutasi realtime otomatis...</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Interactive Manual Check Button -->
                    <button type="button" id="btn-check-manual" onclick="checkStatusManual()"
                        class="w-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 bg-brandBlue hover:bg-brandBlueHover dark:bg-sky-600 dark:hover:bg-sky-500 text-white font-extrabold rounded-2xl transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm active:scale-[0.99]">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate" id="check-icon"></i>
                        <span id="check-btn-text">Saya Sudah Bayar (Cek Sekarang)</span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Supported E-Wallets & Banks -->
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-darkBorder text-center">
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-400 dark:text-darkSubtext uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5">
                            Mendukung Semua Bank & E-Wallet:
                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">GoPay</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">DANA</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">OVO</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">ShopeePay</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">BCA</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">Livin' Mandiri</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">BRImo</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">BNI</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">Seabank</span>
                            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/60 text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400 border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800">Semua QRIS</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Collapsible Step-by-Step Payment Instructions -->
                        <div class="mt-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkBorder rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/60 dark:bg-slate-800/40 text-left">
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleInstructions()" 
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400"></i>
                                    <span>Panduan Cara Bayar QRIS</span>
                                </span>
                                <i id="instruction-arrow" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200"></i>
                            </button>
                            
                            <div id="instruction-content" class="hidden px-4 pb-4 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-700/60 pt-3">
                                <!-- Mode 1: Scan Kamera Langsung -->
                                <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1 text-xs">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-camera text-sky-500"></i>
                                    <span>Opsi 1: Scan Langsung Menggunakan HP Lain</span>
                                </div>
                                <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 pl-1 leading-relaxed">
                                    <li>Buka aplikasi m-Banking (BCA, Mandiri, BRI, BNI) atau E-Wallet (GoPay, DANA, OVO, ShopeePay).</li>
                                    <li>Pilih menu <strong>Bayar / Scan QRIS</strong>.</li>
                                    <li>Arahkan kamera HP ke kode QR di atas.</li>
                                    <li>Pastikan nominal yang ditagihkan sudah sesuai (<span class="font-bold font-mono text-brandBlue dark:text-sky-400"><%= formatRupiah(payment.amount) %></span>).</li>
                                    <li>Masukkan PIN Anda. Transaksi akan terverifikasi otomatis dalam 2-5 detik!</li>
                                </ol>

                                <!-- Mode 2: Dari Galeri HP yang Sama -->
                                <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-2 mb-1 text-xs border-t border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-700/50">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-images text-emerald-500"></i>
                                    <span>Opsi 2: Bayar dari Galeri (Jika di 1 HP)</span>
                                </div>
                                <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 pl-1 leading-relaxed">
                                    <li>Klik tombol <strong>Unduh QR</strong> di atas untuk menyimpan gambar QR ke galeri Anda.</li>
                                    <li>Buka aplikasi m-Banking atau E-Wallet favorit Anda.</li>
                                    <li>Buka menu <strong>Scan QRIS</strong> lalu pilih ikon <strong>Galeri / Upload Gambar</strong>.</li>
                                    <li>Pilih gambar QR yang baru saja diunduh, lalu selesaikan pembayaran.</li>
                                </ol>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Security & Trust Indicators -->
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-400 dark:text-darkSubtext pt-3.5">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check text-emerald-500"></i> Standar QRIS BI & ASPI</span>
                            <span>•</span>
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-sky-500"></i> Enkripsi 256-Bit</span>
                            <span>•</span>
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-amber-500"></i> Realtime Settlement</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- STAGE 2: SUCCESS VIEW (Confirmed Paid) -->
                <div id="stage-success" class="<%= payment.status === 'PAID' ? '' : 'hidden' %> text-center py-2 animate-pop-in">
                    <!-- Big Success Icon Badge -->
